<body data-time="past" class="tab-past">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="/#how">How it works</a><a href="/method/">The method</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/#russ">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free</a></nav>
  </div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-video"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474044159687-1ee9f3a51722?w=1600&q=60&auto=format&fit=crop"><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/11022/11022-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past on">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Life, as learned</p>
        <h1>How you were <em>wired.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Everything you do today runs on something you learned before. Like the frets on a guitar, your wiring decides where the notes can fall. We look at the wiring first.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days of lessons</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#who">Who this is for</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Seven free days from this part of the year. Then $97 a month. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="what"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we look at</p><h2>The things you didn't choose.</h2><p class="lede">Family, money, habits, work: the patterns that were set before you could say no.</p></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>How you were raised</h3><p>The rules you learned about love, money and worth, before you could argue with them.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>How you were taught to work</h3><p>The habits and systems you inherited and never questioned.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>What still runs you</h3><p>The reflexes that show up on a hard day. We name them so you can choose.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>Three kinds of people start here.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You keep repeating a pattern and you're ready to see where it came from.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Leaders</h3><p>Your company runs on habits you set years ago and has outgrown.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Families</h3><p>Two histories under one roof. We make the wiring visible so you can rewire it together.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: seven free days of lessons, then $97 a month, then a 30-minute call with Russ. <a href="/#pricing">See pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529390079861-591de354faf5?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two children drawing together at a table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>How we were taught</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577962917302-cd874c4e31d2?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A diverse team laughing in a meeting" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>How we learned to work</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744094-3a31f272c490?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A developer at two monitors" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>How the systems got built</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="company"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">For businesses</p><h2>Does your company need its systems rewired?</h2><p class="lede">If the thing that's stuck is your tools, workflows and automation, not you, that is a different job. Fretwork Systems does it: fixed-price systems reviews and rebuilds on Microsoft 365, with AI where it helps. Not coaching. Not a law firm.</p></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yes, my business needs automation ↗</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#" data-open-form>No, I want coaching</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final vid-sec" id="begin"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start with the past.</h2><p class="lede">Sign up tonight. Your first lesson is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/#pricing">See pricing</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site"><div class="wrap foot">
    <div><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><p>Daily coaching. $97 a month.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
